    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperb three bedroom semi detached residence in the highly sought after location of Blackrock Village with all amenities within a short stroll of this delightful residence.Accommodation includes a large light filled sitting room, stunning family sized kitchen/diner, utiltiy, guest W.C., three bedrooms and main bathroom. The garage and landscaped gardens are an added bonus.Email 'alison@sfcarroll.com' for application form only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.23m x 1.86m\nWooden floor\n\nSitting Room - 4.8m x 3.6m\nWooden floorFeature fireplace with solid fuel insetCoving & centre piece\n\nKitchen/Diner - 6.9m x 3.4m\nTiled floor in kitchen areaWooden floor in dining areaPart tiled wallsFitted kitchen units with central island\n\nUtility Room - 2.67m x 2.49m\nTiled floor and part tiled walls\n\nGuest WC - 1.5m x 0.8m\nTiled floorWC & WHB\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom One - 3.88m x 3.22m\nBuilt in storage\n\nBedroom Two - 3.23m x 3.23m\nWooden floor\n\nBedroom Three - 3.44m x 3.24m\nBuilt in storage\n\nBathroom - 2.15m x 1.64m\nFully tiledWC, WHB & bath\n\nTOTAL FLOOR AREA - C. 1087 sq. ft. (101 sq. mtrs.)\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Oil fired central heating</li><li>PVC Double glazed</li><li>Quiet cul de sac location</li><li>Garage with roller shutter door</li><li>Landscaped gardens</ul>"
